<h1 align="center">FoldGlass</h1>

<p align="center">
  <b>Every time you open your foldable, the half that swings turns to frosted glass, then clears as it lands flat.</b><br>
  For Android flip and fold phones. Over any app. No root. Completely offline.
</p>

